---
mdv: "1.0"
title: Shared dataset
---

# Regional performance

One declaration, two views. The `dataset` block draws nothing; both charts
below read it by reference, so the two figures cannot drift apart.

```mdv dataset id=sales
fields:
  date: {type: date}
---
date       | region | units | revenue
2026-01-31 | APAC   |  1204 |  482000
2026-01-31 | EMEA   |   980 |  414000
2026-02-28 | APAC   |  1310 |  530000
2026-02-28 | EMEA   |  1015 |  427000
```

## Revenue over time

```mdv line
title: Revenue by month
data: "@sales"
x: date
y: revenue
series: region
```

## Units by region

```mdv bar
title: Units by region
data: "@sales"
x: region
y: units
```
